  "sourceLocator": {
    "chapter": "Playing the Game",
    "section": "1.84",
    "heading": "Falling Off",
    "lineStart": 711,
    "lineEnd": 715
  },
  "section": "1.84",
  "rulesText": "If an effect is about to move your mount against its will while you're on it, you must succeed on a DC 10 Dexterity saving throw or fall off, landing with the Prone condition (see “Rules Glossary”) in an unoccupied space within 5 feet of the mount.\n\nWhile mounted, you must make the same save if you're knocked Prone or the mount is."
}
